title: 'statement-store: restore the full-store fixture and report percentiles in the benchmarks'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The full-store benchmark restores its fixture after the eviction phase and checks the fixture
    size on every start. The add_filter benchmark reports the median and p90, and the
    enforce_limits benchmark waits by the clock until its expiry backlog has expired.
crates:
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: none
